# Scraped/generated data — this is output, not source. It already ends up
# in S3 on every `cdk deploy` (that's what actually serves the live site);
# committing it here too was redundant and is how third-party API keys kept
# leaking into git history via embedded photo/page content. See README for
# how to populate this locally (run the scraper pipeline, or pull the
# current copy down from S3).
public/data/*.json

